  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• To a large bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Thinly slice tomato into wedges.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into sticks.\n• Thinly slice red onion (see ingredients).\n• In a small bowl, combine garlic aioli and harissa paste. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a0625d9e3e3f5847289df0-1130f3ba.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small microwave-safe bowl, combine onion, the white wine vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Microwave onion for 30 second bursts, until softened.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a0625d9e3e3f5847289df0-5b8cdf85.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi, in batches, until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove from heat, then add the honey, turning to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a0625d9e3e3f5847289df0-72906c4d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, cucumber, tomato, pickled onion and a drizzle of olive oil. Season.\n• Microwave mini flourtortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• Top tortillas with pickled onion and cucumber salad and honey haloumi. Drizzle over harissa aioli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a0625d9e3e3f5847289df0-d3362950.jpeg"
    }
  ]
